---
// src/components/storefront/Manifesto.astro
---

<section
  class="relative w-full overflow-hidden border-t border-outline/50 bg-base py-24 md:py-32"
>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 z-0 flex w-full -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center text-center select-none"
  >
    <span
      class="text-[12rem] font-black tracking-tighter whitespace-nowrap text-content/[0.02] md:text-[20rem]"
    >
      NO GAMES.
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-20 max-w-3xl">
      <h2
        class="mb-6 text-4xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-tighter text-content md:text-5xl"
      >
        We buy more <br class="hidden md:block" />
        <span class="text-content-muted">so you pay less.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
        The traditional retail model is broken. Middlemen mark up prices to
        cover expensive storefronts and bloated marketing budgets. We stripped
        the system down to the math.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-16">
      <div
        class="group relative border-l border-outline pl-6 transition-colors duration-500 hover:border-brand/50"
      >
        <span
          class="mb-2 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest text-brand opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100"
          >01</span
        >
        <h3
          class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-content uppercase"
        >
          Direct Sourcing
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
          We negotiate bulk contracts directly with verified distributors and
          brand partners. No unauthorized gray market goods. Ever.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group relative border-l border-outline pl-6 transition-colors duration-500 hover:border-brand/50"
      >
        <span
          class="mb-2 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest text-brand opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100"
          >02</span
        >
        <h3
          class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-content uppercase"
        >
          Margin Compression
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
          Instead of taking a 50% retail margin to fund a bloated operation, we
          take a fraction of that. The remaining delta stays in your pocket.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group relative border-l border-outline pl-6 transition-colors duration-500 hover:border-brand/50"
      >
        <span
          class="mb-2 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest text-brand opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100"
          >03</span
        >
        <h3
          class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-content uppercase"
        >
          The Price Promise
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
          If you find a lower price on an identical item from an authorized
          retailer within 14 days, we match it. Zero friction.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
